# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Two candles to a cell, out of phase and of different heights, so a tiled
# row reads as candles rather than one flame copied. Tile it across a box:
# the box WIDTH is the candle count (two per 8 px).
name: Candle Stick
fps: 8
palette:
  w f4ecd8
  s d8cdb0
  W fff3c4
  y ffd166
  o ff8a00

